MonitorPin
Copyright (c) 2026 AemiliusXIV

A Windows tray tool for placing application windows and force-minimizing
fullscreen games.

This application has no bundled third-party runtime dependencies. It is built
on .NET and Windows Forms and calls the Windows API directly; those components
are part of the .NET runtime and the operating system and are not redistributed
by this project.

The installer is produced with Inno Setup (https://jrsoftware.org/isinfo.php),
a build-time tool that is not included in the application itself.
